OL,3,BBankruptcy filings in Finland hit      
OL,4,Brecord high for 2000s                  
OL,5,GMore than 4,000 Finnish companies have 
OL,6,Gfiled for bankruptcy in the past year, 
OL,7,Gthe highest annual total since the turn
OL,8,Gof the millennium.                     
OL,9,K                                       
OL,10,BHSL to trial pay-as-you-go ticket      
OL,11,GPassengers in the trial would pay less 
OL,12,Gthan they do now for travelling short  
OL,13,Gdistances.                             
OL,14,K                                       
